  "request_id": "457adb61-213f-403c-ac5a-734feb1e23fe",
  "log_id": "20260803012330EEF7DB4A2146B57FE52B",
  "duration_seconds": 44.141,
  "bytes": 706988,
  "audio_sha256": "957b5158173a1704e98877fee64d9eb1651cfd8ad7683ecc804027cc74ef5eb9",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0073",
      "text": "现在，原料和产品也要像劳动一样，从另一个角度来看。",
      "start_ms": 360,
      "end_ms": 6000,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0074",
      "text": "在劳动过程本身中，棉花是要被加工的对象，纱是加工的结果。",
      "start_ms": 6840,
      "end_ms": 14120,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0075",
      "text": "现在考察价值时，棉花只被看作吸收一定数量劳动的材料。",
      "start_ms": 14840,
      "end_ms": 20600,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0076",
      "text": "它吸收了以纺纱形式耗费的劳动力，所以确实变成了纱。",
      "start_ms": 21240,
      "end_ms": 26840,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0077",
      "text": "但这时，纱的作用只是显示棉花吸收了多少劳动。",
      "start_ms": 27800,
      "end_ms": 32960,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0078",
      "text": "假定一小时可以把1⅔磅棉花纺成1⅔磅纱，那么10磅纱就表示其中吸收了6小时劳动。",
      "start_ms": 33760,
      "end_ms": 43960,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    }
  ]
}
